            "review_title": "Review at Cos Barbershop",
            "review_text": "glenellis16\nMelbourne, Australia439 contributions\n0\nAwesome experience.\nJan 2020 • Solo\nNot usually one for a usual ‘spa’ experience, so fortunately this wasn’t usual!!!! The full package consists of shave, massage, facial, ear cleanse, hand and toe nail clip, shampoo and condition and scalp massage all delivered by a therapist dressed as a cartoon caraticure. All therapists are wearing short shirts and tight tops as various cartoons. The walls are decorated with cartoon paintings made it fun too. \nAside from the aesthetics (which were great) the treatment was also great. She was very skilled with all works completed. \nA very pleasant way to spend an hour and a half after a long hot day in Saigon\nRead more\nWritten January 2, 2020",
